Package: stac.pointcloud.bc
Type: Project
Title: Manifest for the stac_pointcloud_bc landing page
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Not an R package. The catalogue is built in Python (pyproject.toml);
    this DESCRIPTION declares the R packages that render README.Rmd to README.md
    and index.html, so one call installs them:
    pak::local_install_dev_deps("scripts"). It sits in scripts/, not at the
    root, because a root DESCRIPTION would move the repo onto gh-pr-merge's
    manifest release route, which leaves tagging to a release script this repo
    does not have.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
